\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Closed forms from \eqref  {eq:rec}--\eqref  {eq:ratios}. Branch-aware sharing matches APC on prefill and is cheaper than recompute by $(1+k\varepsilon )/(k(1+\varepsilon ))$. After abort, $M_{\mathrm  {spine}}$ is the occupancy used by efficient serving, below both, which raises $C\propto \mathrm  {HBM}/M$.}}{8}{table.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
