\newlabel{fig:acc}{{4}{11}{Official GSM8K extractor, running accuracy. Tree-of-Thoughts accuracy ($\approx 0.845$) is below single-path generation ($\approx 0.941$) because several thoughts compete. The committed path after abort is the same winner decode as APC, so scores stay aligned}{figure.caption.12}{}}
