\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces Qwen3-14B storage and generate time. Peak KV equals the 8B suite and is independent of $\mathrm  {tp}$. Wall-clock is within $3\%$ of APC except SVAMP at two GPUs ($-5.3\%$), where ForkServe emits fewer winner tokens.}}{16}{table.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
