\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces Official accuracy, APC vs.\ ForkServe, $\mathrm  {tp}{=}2$ and $\mathrm  {tp}{=}4$. Parentheses are correct counts. The last row is micro-average over the union of the seven files ($5{\times }80+73+40{=}513$). At two GPUs ForkServe is ahead on six files and on the pool ($+9$ problems). At four GPUs the pool is within seven problems; no file differs by more than three.}}{19}{table.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
