\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {27}{\ignorespaces Setting N GSM8K, $\mathrm  {tp}{=}2$. Left: APC always emits $nD$; ForkServe already stops on EOS; ForkServe+ stops earlier. Right: ForkServe tracks APC accuracy; ForkServe+ matches on Llama-3-8B and drops on Qwen3-4B / Mistral / Qwen3-14B.}}{31}{figure.caption.62}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {36}{\ignorespaces Last-line answer stop, $n{=}32$, $\mathrm  {tp}{=}2$. GSM8K peak is $1093/1493{=}0.73$, $1085/1485{=}0.73$, and $1121/1521{=}0.74$ of APC. ForkServe+ decode tokens are $0.77\times $, $0.31\times $, and $0.41\times $ APC. DeepSeek-R1 ForkServe+ scores $18/32$, above APC. Llama-3-8B stays within one problem of APC; Mistral-7B loses five problems. Game24 peaks are $0.58\times $, $0.60\times $, and $0.56\times $ APC. Success stays at most $1/32$ because $D{=}256$ does not finish an equation. Llama-3-8B Game24 emits $32$ decode tokens on every system (immediate EOS).}}{31}{table.caption.63}\protected@file@percent }
